config RT_DVFS_SUN252I_F101_CPUFREQ
    bool "Allwinner Sun252i F101 CPUfreq driver"
    depends on RT_USING_DVFS
    default y
    help
      Register the C907 CPU as a frequency-only DVFS device. The CPU PLL
      supports linear frequency modulation; YuzukiNeko OPPs are supplied by
      its device tree and do not require a controllable CPU regulator.
